# Camera originals stay local by default: they carry a full EXIF block including
# GPS, and dropping one into the tree should never be a one-command mistake.
# Publishing such a fixture takes the deliberate negation below — that extra step
# is the point.
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.heif
*.HEIF
*.arw
*.ARW
*.cr2
*.CR2
*.cr3
*.CR3
*.nef
*.NEF
*.dng
*.DNG

# The exception: a small HEIC fixture published on purpose, so the sips conversion
# branch of examples/photo-rag can be demonstrated by anyone who clones this, not
# merely asserted. Real camera files at 1024 px, ~180 KB each, with the capture
# metadata intact — 15 GPS keys, 36 EXIF keys, camera and date.
!tests_2.0/assets/geo-test/heic/*.heic
benchmarks/reports/*.html
benchmarks/reports/2025-12*.jsonl
benchmarks/reports/2026-0[12]*.jsonl

